Contingency table functions (:mod:`scipy.stats.contingency`)
============================================================

Functions for creating and analyzing contingency tables.

.. currentmodule:: scipy.stats.contingency

.. autosummary::
   :toctree: generated/

   chi2_contingency
   relative_risk
   odds_ratio
   crosstab
   association

   expected_freq
   margins

