        cdf(x)

        Approximated cumulative distribution function of the given distribution.

        Parameters
        ----------
        x : array_like
            Quantiles, with the last axis of `x` denoting the components.

        Returns
        -------
        cdf : array_like
            Approximated cumulative distribution function evaluated at `x`.
